{"pageid":3640,"title":"Snowdrift Station A & B","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Snowdrift Station A &amp; B</span>","revid":16430,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice\" style=\"border-radius:15px; border:3px solid #3C3C3C; background:#505050; font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p style=\"margin-bottom:.3em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:semi-bold\">This page is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Stubs\" title=\"Category:Stubs\">stub</a>!</span><br />\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Snowdrift_Station_A_%26_B?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Snowdrift Station A &#38; B</h2>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sleepy_Bridgeman\" title=\"Sleepy Bridgeman\">Sleepy Bridgeman</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Bring a player across the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a> through a cablecar</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.71.0\" title=\"Version 1.71.0\">Version 1.71.0</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Snowdrift Stations A and B</b> were added in the <a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.71.0\" title=\"Version 1.71.0\">1.71.0 Christmas Update</a> on December 1st, 2024. It was added alongside a full map revamp of the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowlands</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\">Usage</span></h2>\n<p>The cablecar is to bring cars to and from each station, aka across the biome. It is also an easy way to get to <a href=\"/wiki/Gizmo%27s_Observatory\" title=\"Gizmo&#39;s Observatory\">Gizmo's Observatory</a>. In order to use it, you need either ~$2,500 or a <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Keycard\" title=\"Red Keycard\">Red Keycard</a>. The cablecar takes about 33 seconds to go from one side to the other not including wait times.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>During the first few days of <a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.71.0\" title=\"Version 1.71.0\">Version 1.71.0</a> being out, the Cablecar was bugged, meaning it would be nonfunctional, the <a href=\"/wiki/Sleepy_Bridgeman\" title=\"Sleepy Bridgeman\">Sleepy Bridgeman</a> would steal your money, and the Cablecar itself would be on the ground.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163622\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 77/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 626/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 36/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019524/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.672      1 -total\n 90.26%   28.587      1 Template:Buildings\n  9.63%    3.049      1 Template:Stub\n  3.89%    1.233      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3640-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163622 and revision id 16430. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Stubs"],"links":[{"title":"Sleepy Bridgeman","exists":true},{"title":"Snowlands","exists":true},{"title":"Version 1.71.0","exists":true},{"title":"Gizmo's Observatory","exists":true},{"title":"Red Keycard","exists":tr